   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Dark light pockets: median ~48, crushed blacks (p1 ~1), magenta-cool shadows (28,20,24), warm highlights (219,210,207), blue 23% + aqua 19% + red 26% + magenta 13%, saturation 0.37, skin hue 21. Best for: Stations and platforms, shafts of light, dark interiors with one light source, night markets, dramatic single-subject frames. Very dark - hero frames.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
